ey planned those defense systems  and what tactics they were practicing I  know those people and I looked into  their faces that might be the only  aspect that makes this bearable for me  at the moment I'm not a tourist in  Ukraine and right now I'm not a German  politician watching events on livestream  I'm also a part of this movement  someone's been o tired easily  you
 

